<title>USA: McKesson wins Chronimed contract.</title>
<headline>McKesson wins Chronimed contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp said its U.S. Health Care unit signed an exclusive prime-vendor agreement to provide pharmaceuticals and other products and services to Chronimed Inc.</p>
<p>The agreement, which becomes effective on November 1, will result in annual sales of more than $100 million, McKesson said.</p>
<p>McKesson Corp, a provider of pharmaceuticals and health care products and services, has total annual revenues of close to $14 billion. Chronimed develops and markets drugs focusing on the needs of patients with chronic diseases.</p>
</text>
